[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Generic-boundary rows tested anyway (Phase C)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The task requires covering the generic boundaries every C API has, even when the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m table is empty. These rows assert **identical behaviour**, not "both fail",
