[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     80[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C12 | `tritanopia` | Axis2 `R'=p, G'=l, B'=l` — R' above threshold while G',B' at/below it: `R` large, `G=B=0` | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     81[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C13 | `tritanopia` | Axis2 `R'=p, G'=p, B'=p` — all above threshold (ordinary mid/bright colours) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     82[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C14 | `tritanopia` | Axis2 `G'` and `B'` branch **differ** — needs `0.8739*G+0.1260*B` within ~1e-9 of the threshold; probed by a targeted search plus the exhaustive row (recorded as reachable-or-not, not assumed) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     83[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C15 | `tritanopia` | Axis3 R=`neg` — red channel driven below 0 so `y < 0` and the cast wraps: `R` small, `B >> G` (e.g. `{0,0,255}`) | [x] |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     84[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C16 | `tritanopia` | Axis3 R=`ovf` — red channel driven above 1 so `y >= 256` and the cast wraps: `R` large, `G >> B` (e.g. `{255,255,0}`) | [x] |
